<title>INDIA: Stocks which moved India's BSE Index - Dec 20.</title>
<headline>Stocks which moved India's BSE Index - Dec 20.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1996-12-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Following is an analysis of the 30-share Bombay Stock Exchange (BSE) index movement on Friday.</p>
<p>The table shows the stocks which moved the index most during the day (upto 0640 GMT)and their percentage contribution to the net change.</p>
<p>The index at (0640 GMT) was 3070.59, 34.43 points or 1.13 percent higher than Thursday's close.</p>
